B.ay3=new A.eT("Our Mission","To empower every child and family we serve with access to quality education, healthcare, and livelihood support \u2014 building a more equitable society, one community at a time.")
B.axR=new A.eT("Our Impact","15,000+ children supported  \xb7  \u20b98.2 Cr+ raised  \xb7  48 partner NGOs  \xb7  12 districts reached\n\nEvery rupee donated is tracked, accounted for, and directed toward maximum beneficiary impact.")
